     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">Dear Altuna,<br></font></span><br>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">I have tried to update methylkit to the last version\nbut I get the following error:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">#I run this code<span style=\"background:#002240\"><br>\n</span>library(devtools)</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">install_github(&quot;al2na/methylKit&quot;,build_vignettes=FALSE)<span style=\"background:#002240\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\n#I get the following error<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n</span><span style=\"font-size:6.5pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">ERROR: dependency &#39;S4Vectors&#39; is not available for\npackage &#39;methylKit&#39;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">* removing\n&#39;D:/Users/JL/Documents/R/win-library/3.1/methylKit&#39;<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nAnd due to this I lost my previous version of Methylkit and can&#39;t update it\neither.<br>\n<br>\nHow can this issue be fixed?<br>\n<br>\nThanks in advance<br>\n<br>\nJL</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(0,34,64)\"></span></span><br></div>"
